<Positioned left="68" top="1214"><Text fontSize="24" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">4 · 错误分类与处理</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1254" width="290"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">400 PARSE_ERROR</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="372" top="1254"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">语法/属性错误，消息带行列与偏移，改 DSL 后重发。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1281" width="290"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">413 REQUEST_TOO_LARGE</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="372" top="1281"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">请求体越限：减少嵌套或拆成多次调用。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1308" width="290"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">429 / 503</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="372" top="1308"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">限流或暂时故障：参考 Retry-After 后重试。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1335" width="290"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">401</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="372" top="1335"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">需要凭据：放在请求头，不写进 DSL 或提示词。</Text></Positioned>
